                    <a href="https://wa.me/201095942001" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs shadow-lg">
                        <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-lg"></i>
                        <span>محادثة واتساب مباشرة للطلب</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="border-t border-darkborder/60 pt-6 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">
